#, php-format
msgid "Any OpenAI-compatible provider. No account yet? %s — signing up through that link grants bonus credits to both you and this project, and the free credits go a long way."
msgstr "任何 OpenAI 兼容的服务商都可以。还没有账号?%s——通过该链接注册,你和本项目都会获得赠送额度,免费额度足够用很久。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:240
msgid "get a key from SiliconFlow"
msgstr "到 SiliconFlow 领一个密钥"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:247
msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "API 基础地址"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:249
msgid "HTTPS only."
msgstr "仅支持 HTTPS。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:252
msgid "Vision models"
msgstr "视觉模型"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:254
msgid "One per line, in priority order. If one is unavailable the next is used automatically."
msgstr "每行一个,按优先级排序。前一个不可用时自动切换到下一个。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:257
msgid "Text models"
msgstr "文本模型"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:261
msgid "Daily token cap"
msgstr "每日 token 上限"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:264
msgid "Batches stop when the cap is hit and continue the next day. 0 = no cap."
msgstr "达到上限批次即停,次日自动继续。0 表示不限。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:267
msgid "Site context"
msgstr "站点背景"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:268
msgid "e.g. Tech review blog; recurring brands: xiaomi, dji, anker"
msgstr "例如:数码评测博客;常见品牌:小米、大疆、安克"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:269
msgid "Describing your niche and recurring proper nouns noticeably improves accuracy."
msgstr "描述你的领域和常出现的专有名词,能明显提高准确率。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:277
msgid "Append rules to robots.txt"
msgstr "向 robots.txt 追加规则"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:279
msgid "Adds to what WordPress and other plugins output — never replaces it."
msgstr "只在 WordPress 与其他插件的输出之后追加——绝不替换。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:283
msgid "Send noindex headers on outbound redirects"
msgstr "为出站跳转发送 noindex 响应头"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:285
msgid "Keeps redirect endpoints (e.g. affiliate short links) out of search results while staying crawlable — blocking them in robots.txt would hide the noindex from crawlers and backfire."
msgstr "让跳转端点(如联盟短链)不进搜索结果,同时保持可抓取——若用 robots.txt 屏蔽,爬虫反而看不到 noindex,适得其反。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:290
msgid "Structured data & canonicals"
msgstr "结构化数据与 Canonical"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:295
msgid "Output JSON-LD structured data"
msgstr "输出 JSON-LD 结构化数据"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:297
msgid "Article, breadcrumb, site and organization markup. Turn off if another SEO plugin already provides it."
msgstr "文章、面包屑、站点与组织标记。若已有其他 SEO 插件提供,请关闭。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:301
msgid "Add canonical tags on home and archive pages"
msgstr "为首页与归档页添加 canonical 标签"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:303
msgid "Only where themes commonly miss them — single posts are left to your theme, duplicate canonicals are worse than none."
msgstr "只补主题普遍缺失的位置——单篇交给你的主题,重复的 canonical 比没有更糟。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:308
msgid "Meta description tag"
msgstr "META 描述标签"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:312
msgid "Print the meta description tag"
msgstr "输出 meta description 标签"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:314
msgid "Turn off if your theme or SEO plugin already prints one — descriptions are still written and stored either way, and the aaseo_description_meta_key filter can store them directly in your theme's own field."
msgstr "若你的主题或 SEO 插件已输出该标签,请关闭——描述照常生成并保存,且可通过 aaseo_description_meta_key 过滤器直接写入主题自己的字段。"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:318
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

#: admin/class-aaseo-admin.php:327
msgid "No task modules are active yet."
msgstr "尚无启用的任务模块。"

