msgstr "本地找不到图片文件。"

#. translators: %s: job slug
#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown job: %s"
msgstr "未知任务:%s"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:84
msgid "Job is not ready to run (API key missing?)"
msgstr "任务尚不可运行(是否缺少 API 密钥?)"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:87
msgid "Action Scheduler unavailable."
msgstr "Action Scheduler 不可用。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:251
msgid "Daily token cap reached; will continue tomorrow."
msgstr "已达每日 token 上限,明天自动继续。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:403
msgid "image file no longer exists on disk (orphaned attachment record — safe to clean up)"
msgstr "图片文件已不在磁盘上(孤儿附件记录——可放心清理)"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:404
msgid "too small to be meaningful content (logo/icon — alt is intentionally left empty)"
msgstr "尺寸太小,不构成有意义的内容(logo/图标——alt 特意留空)"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:405
msgid "already written by a human — left untouched"
msgstr "已有人工撰写——原样保留"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:406
msgid "existing description already does its job (AI-judged) — left untouched"
msgstr "现有描述已经合格(AI 判定)——原样保留"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:407
msgid "post has no content to describe"
msgstr "文章没有可描述的内容"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:408
msgid "post no longer exists or is not published"
msgstr "文章已不存在或未发布"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:409
msgid "too few posts to be worth describing (threshold configurable)"
msgstr "文章数太少,不值得撰写描述(阈值可配置)"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:410
msgid "no related posts share a category or tag — nothing worth linking to"
msgstr "没有同分类/同标签的相关文章——没有值得链接的目标"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:411
msgid "reviewed — no link scored high enough to suggest (that is a pass, not a failure)"
msgstr "已审阅——没有链接达到建议门槛(这是通过,不是失败)"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:412
msgid "no outbound links to check"
msgstr "没有出站链接可检查"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:413
msgid "all outbound links respond — nothing to report"
msgstr "所有出站链接均有响应——无需报告"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:420
msgid "first draft ran too long and was rewritten to fit"
msgstr "初稿过长,已重写至合适长度"

#: includes/class-aaseo-jobs.php:421
msgid "first draft came back in the wrong language and was rewritten in the site's language"
msgstr "初稿语言不对,已按站点语言重写"

#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:105
#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:158
msgid "Suggestion no longer pending."
msgstr "该建议已不在待审状态。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:115
msgid "Source or target post is gone; suggestion marked stale."
msgstr "来源或目标文章已不存在,建议标记为失效。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:120
msgid "Post already links to this target; suggestion marked stale."
msgstr "文章已链接到该目标,建议标记为失效。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:127
msgid "Anchor text no longer found in the post (content changed?); suggestion marked stale."
msgstr "文章中已找不到锚文本(内容改过?),建议标记为失效。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-links.php:141
msgid "This post contains markup (e.g. iframes) that your account cannot re-save; approving would strip it. Ask an administrator with unfiltered_html to approve this one."
msgstr "这篇文章包含你的账号无权重新保存的标记(如 iframe),批准会把它们剥掉。请让拥有 unfiltered_html 权限的管理员来批准这条。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:186
msgid "WP-CLI available — batches run with no web timeout. Strongest path."
msgstr "WP-CLI 可用——批次不受 Web 超时限制,这是最强路径。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:187
msgid "Running through Action Scheduler: work continues across requests via loopback, so a web timeout cannot stop a batch."
msgstr "通过 Action Scheduler 运行:任务经回环请求跨请求接力,单次 Web 超时无法中断批次。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:188
msgid "Limited environment — processing a couple of items per request. Consider running via WP-CLI."
msgstr "受限环境——每个请求只处理少量条目。建议改用 WP-CLI 运行。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:193
msgid "PHP reports no execution limit, but hosts often cut web requests off in front of PHP — measured timing is used instead of this value."
msgstr "PHP 报告无执行时限,但主机常在 PHP 之前掐断 Web 请求——因此采用实测耗时,而非这个报告值。"

#. translators: 1: sample count, 2: median seconds, 3: timeout seconds
#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:198
#, php-format
msgid "Measured on this site: %1$d samples, median %2$ss per item — per-call timeout set to %3$ss."
msgstr "本站实测:%1$d 个样本,单条中位耗时 %2$s 秒——单次调用超时设为 %3$s 秒。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:202
msgid "No measurements yet — conservative defaults in use. They tighten automatically once a batch has run."
msgstr "尚无实测数据——使用保守默认值,跑过一个批次后自动收紧。"

#. translators: %s: percentage
#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:208
#, php-format
msgid "Recent failures detected — throughput reduced to %s%% until things recover."
msgstr "检测到近期失败——吞吐已降至 %s%%,恢复后自动回升。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-probe.php:213
msgid "Jetpack image CDN detected — images are resized on the CDN, saving local processing."
msgstr "检测到 Jetpack 图片 CDN——图片在 CDN 端缩放,节省本地处理。"

#: includes/class-aaseo-schema.php:182
